WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,030 --> 00:00:06,190
Oh my god, there are so many cigarettes, and they all fit into the car.

2
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,960
In the apocalypse, this thing is hard currency

3
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,440
Much more useful than banknotes

4
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:24,450
It’s been half a year now and I no longer have to make instant noodles every day.

5
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:32,200
Go and see if anyone has been imprisoned by them

6
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,440
They are all poor people

7
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,440
In this doomsday

8
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,280
It's so difficult to fall into the hands of such a person

9
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:48,080
Without strength, you can only be bullied

10
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:49,980
this is reality
